REM capslock_prank.duck [FUNNY] - toggles CAPS LOCK a few times then leaves it
REM exactly as it started (even number of toggles). Harmless, just silly.
DELAY 800
CAPSLOCK
DELAY 300
CAPSLOCK
DELAY 300
CAPSLOCK
DELAY 300
CAPSLOCK
DELAY 300
CAPSLOCK
DELAY 300
CAPSLOCK
DELAY 300
CAPSLOCK
DELAY 300
CAPSLOCK
